    "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:33:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-13T02:33:34Z",
    "body": "For `window.stop()` to abort a cross-document navigation, the `ongoing navigate event` must still be around. For cross-document cases, where the lifetime of the page is at its end, that should be fine. However, this interferes with the reload case I tried to describe in the issue description.",
